WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
One point zero one, to the power ten.

2
00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.670
A pencil starts multiplying it out.

3
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.820
Line after line of long decimals.

4
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.160
Then it stops.

5
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.770
Is there a shortcut to
four decimal places,

6
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.280
with no calculator?

7
00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.080
Is it just one point one?

8
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.680
One point two one?

9
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:22.800
In this mission, you'll use Pascal's
triangle and n C r to find the coefficients

10
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.510
of a plus b, to the power n.

11
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.460
You'll write a number as a
bracket with a small part,

12
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:31.480
turning the power into
a binomial expansion.

13
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:36.470
With a small x, the terms shrink fast,
so the first few give a good estimate.

14
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:40.370
Your mission: work out one
point zero one to the power ten,

15
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.920
to four decimal places, in your head.
